			"hadithnumber": 2157,
			"arabicnumber": 2157,
			"text": "Abu Hurairah said:\"Idolaters from the Quraish came to the Messenger of Allah (s.a.w) quarreling about Al-Qadar. So this Ayah was revealed: \"The day they will be dragged on their faces into the Fire (it will be said to them): \"Taste you the touch of Hell.\" Verily we have created all things with Qadar",
